text = "Production is still a major WIP. To produce a unit, click on a worker, then click a unit to queue production of that unit. There is currently no limit to the number of units that can be in a queue. Produced units will automatically be added to your force pool. Units cannot currently be cancelled. Production times vary by unit. "
